  mvdescribe.py  appearance analysis of the character reference image: the
               system prompt and the JSON shape (subject / face / hair /
               outfit / style / identity_anchor). Ported from
               app/services/llm.py (analyze_character).
               Modified: async call to this studio's vision LLM client; the
               prompt asks for the appearance only (no expression, location,
               lighting, pose or action) and for a one-line Japanese
               description; one JSON-repair retry; fallbacks to the image's
               ledger prompt or a neutral text. The song listening (listen_song) and
               the song-concept proposal (propose_concept) in the same file are
               new code for this studio.
